        "text": "**B**, because behind the veil of ignorance the risk of landing at the bottom weighs heavily. Secure housing, healthcare, and education protect against the worst outcomes, and I'd rather accept a lower ceiling than risk a precarious floor. Reasonable people could weigh the greater prosperity of the other society differently.",
